- **Emery Berger** (emeryberger.com) — redirects to his GitHub profile page. No personal site at all.
- **Scott Aaronson** (scottaaronson.blog) — WordPress, custom theme literally named `ohmygod`.
- **Terence Tao** (terrytao.wordpress.com) — WordPress.com, Tarski theme, 602KB.
- **Ed Chi** (edchi.net) — Google Sites (gstatic "atari" bundle, Lato + Google Sans + Roboto + Source Code Pro). This is roughly what Prof. Regonda has today.
- **Fernanda Viégas** (fernandaviegas.com) — 1,164-byte shell, Meteor-built JS app.
- **Daniela Rus** (danielarus.csail.mit.edu) — Avada WordPress + RevSlider, **1,436,528 bytes** of homepage HTML, Lato.
- **Regina Barzilay** (people.csail.mit.edu/regina/) — Wix, 548,929 bytes, fonts `din-next-w01-light`, `wf_34f7b8ddea86409f84985334d`.
